{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"horse_tack","model_identifier":"horse_tack","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# horse_tack\n\nHorse tack (B1 attachment): saddle, team-colour saddle cloth and bridle for `horse`.\n\nRiding saddle with pommel and cantle, girth, stirrup leathers with iron stirrups, a team-colour saddle cloth with gold trim, bridle (noseband, headstall) and reins along the neck. Built on the full horse skeleton (same bone names and pivots) and a copy of every horse clip (same names and keys), so it can be bound to the horse skeleton or simply played in sync with the horse.\n\n- Cubes: 15 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.0..9.0, y 32.4..71.2, z -51.7..7.3 (faces -Z).\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `trot` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop |  |\n| `gallop` | 0.46 | loop |  |\n| `pull` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop |  |\n| `rear` | 1.8 | once |  |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold |  |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 55, -2)\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 44, -30)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `horse_tack_blue.png`: saddle cloth in blue (team colour)\n- `horse_tack_green.png`: saddle cloth in green (team colour)\n- `horse_tack_yellow.png`: saddle cloth in yellow (team colour)\n- `horse_tack_plain.png`: saddle cloth in plain (no team colour, brown cloth)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Cubes on neck and head carry the same fixed cube rotations as the horse (-38 / -52 deg).\n- Default saddle cloth is red; the variant textures recolour only the cloth.\n"},"description":"# horse_tack\n\nHorse tack (B1 attachment): saddle, team-colour saddle cloth and bridle for `horse`.\n\nRiding saddle with pommel and cantle, girth, stirrup leathers with iron stirrups, a team-colour saddle cloth with gold trim, bridle (noseband, headstall) and reins along the neck. Built on the full horse skeleton (same bone names and pivots) and a copy of every horse clip (same names and keys), so it can be bound to the horse skeleton or simply played in sync with the horse.\n\n- Cubes: 15 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.0..9.0, y 32.4..71.2, z -51.7..7.3 (faces -Z).\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `trot` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop |  |\n| `gallop` | 0.46 | loop |  |\n| `pull` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop |  |\n| `rear` | 1.8 | once |  |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold |  |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 55, -2)\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 44, -30)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `horse_tack_blue.png`: saddle cloth in blue (team colour)\n- `horse_tack_green.png`: saddle cloth in green (team colour)\n- `horse_tack_yellow.png`: saddle cloth in yellow (team colour)\n- `horse_tack_plain.png`: saddle cloth in plain (no team colour, brown cloth)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Cubes on neck and head carry the same fixed cube rotations as the horse (-38 / -52 deg).\n- Default saddle cloth is red; the variant textures recolour only the cloth.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"saddle_cloth","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.5,40.0,-12.0],"to":[7.5,52.0,7.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.3,"origin":[0.0,46.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[38,40,53.0,52.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,40,19.0,52.0],"texture":0},"sout